B. Call for the records, C. Issue Rule Nisi calling upon the opp. Parties as to why the notification issued under Section 4(1), 17(4) and Section 6 of L.A. Act, 1894 under Sushanti Sahoo vs State Of Odisha And Others ..... ... on 9 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/3558698/
